# Git Rules

## Branch Naming Convention

All feature branches must follow this format:

name/<short-kebab-case-description>

Example:
laurence/profile-card-context

## Requirements

- Always create a new branch before making feature changes
- Never modify code directly on `main`
- Follow the naming convention exactly
- After creating a branch, confirm the branch name using `git branch`
